els.com/video-files/4896507/4896507-hd_1080_1920_30fps.mp4"], [[29.96, 34.18], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/8426828/8426828-hd_1080_1920_30fps.mp4"], [[34.18, 36.88], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/8959184/8959184-hd_1080_1920_25fps.mp4"]]}, "7": {"_id": "2e17ac7d8fa2485cbbf4b361", "content_type": "general_video", "ready_to_upload": false, "last_completed_step": 5, "language": "English", "auto_music": true, "background_music_name": "", "script": "Love is a powerful force that can motivate us to do incredible things. It pushes us beyond our limits, inspiring us to achieve more and be better. When we love, we find the strength to overcome challenges and the courage to chase our dreams. Love can transform our lives, making the impossible seem possible. So, let your love be your guide and your motivation. Embrace it, nurture it, and watch how it transforms your world.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/2e17ac7d8fa2485cbbf4b361/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/2e17ac7d8fa2485cbbf4b361/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.2, 0.68], "Love is a"], [[0.68, 1.36], "powerful force"], [[1.36, 1.72], "that can"], [[1.72, 2.48], "motivate us to"], [[2.48, 3.02], "do incredible"], [[3.02, 4.58], "things. It"], [[4.58, 5.1], "pushes us"], [[5.1, 5.58], "beyond our"], [[5.58, 5.86], "limits,"], [[6.14, 6.94], "inspiring us to"], [[6.94, 7.5], "achieve more"], [[7.5, 7.8], "and be"], [[7.8, 9.38], "better. When we"], [[9.38, 10.2], "love, we find"], [[10.2, 10.82], "the strength to"], [[10.82, 11.1], "overcome"], [[11.1, 11.96], "challenges and"], [[11.96, 12.58], "the courage to"], [[12.58, 13.02], "chase our"], [[13.02, 14.66], "dreams. Love"], [[14.66, 15.36], "can transform"], [[15.36, 15.58], "our"], [[15.58, 16.36], "lives, making"], [[16.36, 16.98], "the impossible"], [[16.98, 17.32], "seem"], [[17.32, 17.78], "possible."], [[18.8, 19.56], "So, let your"], [[19.5