 it transforms your life in ways you never thought possible.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/e703d92939db48fdba71eebe/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/e703d92939db48fdba71eebe/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.2, 0.72], "Love is not"], [[0.72, 1.14], "just a"], [[1.14, 1.9], "feeling, it's a"], [[1.9, 2.18], "powerful"], [[2.18, 2.98], "motivator that"], [[2.98, 3.74], "can drive us to"], [[3.74, 4.14], "incredible"], [[4.14, 5.74], "heights. It"], [[5.74, 6.48], "inspires us to"], [[6.48, 6.6], "be"], [[6.6, 7.4], "better, to push"], [[7.4, 7.9], "beyond our"], [[7.9, 8.62], "limits, and to"], [[8.62, 9.2], "support those"], [[9.2, 9.58], "we care"], [[9.58, 11.2], "about. When we"], [[11.2, 12.0], "love, we find"], [[12.0, 12.64], "the strength to"], [[12.64, 12.92], "overcome"], [[12.92, 13.76], "obstacles and"], [[13.76, 14.42], "the courage to"], [[14.42, 14.86], "chase our"], [[14.86, 16.48], "dreams. Love"], [[16.48, 17.0], "gives us a"], [[17.0, 17.38], "sense of"], [[17.38, 17.98], "purpose and"], [[17.98, 18.34], "belonging,"], [[18.6, 19.2], "making every"], [[19.2, 19.84], "challenge feel"], [[19.84, 20.4], "a little bit"], [[20.4, 20.6], "more"], [[20.6, 21.0], "manageable."], [[22.06, 23.12], "So, let love be"], [[23.12, 23.52], "your guiding"], [[23.52, 25.26], "light. Embrace"], [[25.26, 26.04], "it, nurture"], [[25.8, 26.52], "it, and watch"], [[26.52, 26.78], "as it"], [[26.78, 27.54], "transforms your"], [[27.54, 28.18], "life in ways"], [[28.18, 28.58], "you never"], [[28.58, 28.82], "thought"], [[28.82, 30.24], "possible. Love"], [[30.24, 30.32], "is not just a"], [[30.32, 30.36], "feeling, but"], [[30.36, 30.42], "it's a powerful"], [[30.42, 30.46], "motivator that"], [[30.46, 30.54], "can drive us to"], [[30.54, 30.56], "incredible"], [[30.56, 30.58], "heights."]], "timed_video_searches": [[[0.0, 4.324], ["heart beat", "couples walking", "su