nd let it be your greatest source of motivation.", "format_vertical": false, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/8dcef403bb5144279726e884/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/8dcef403bb5144279726e884/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.22, 1.36], "Love is a powerful force"], [[1.36, 2.56], "that can inspire us to"], [[2.56, 3.0], "do amazing"], [[3.0, 4.82], "things. When we"], [[4.82, 6.1], "love, we are motivated to"], [[6.1, 7.28], "support and care for those"], [[7.28, 7.46], "we"], [[7.46, 9.54], "cherish. Love gives us the"], [[9.54, 10.3], "strength to overcome"], [[10.3, 11.78], "challenges and the courage to"], [[11.78, 12.28], "pursue our"], [[12.28, 14.34], "dreams. It can push us"], [[14.34, 15.34], "to be better versions of"], [[15.34, 16.74], "ourselves, to grow and to"], [[16.74, 18.9], "thrive. Whether it's the love"], [[18.9, 19.2], "for a"], [[19.2, 20.16], "partner, a family"], [[20.16, 20.94], "member, or a"], [[20.94, 21.96], "friend, it has the power"], [[21.96, 23.34], "to transform our lives and"], [[23.34, 24.32], "make the world a brighter"], [[24.32, 26.64], "place. Embrace the love in"], [[26.64, 27.66], "your life and let it"], [[27.66, 28.78], "be your greatest source of"], [[28.78, 29.24], "motivation."]], "timed_video_searches": [[[0.22, 4.82], ["heart beat", "candle light", "holding hands"]], [[4.82, 9.54], ["smiling faces", "hugging couple", "family gathering"]], [[9.54, 14.34], ["mountain climb", "ocean waves", "sunset beach"]], [[14.34, 19.2], ["growing plant", "child learning", "reading book"]], [[19.2, 23.34], ["wedding ring", "baby laugh", "group hug"]], [[23.34, 28.78], ["city lights", "starry night", "garden bloom"]], [[28.78, 29.24], ["sunrise sky", "flower petals", "peaceful lake"]]], "timed_video_urls": [[[0.22, 4.82], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/3327617/3327617-hd_1920_1080_24fps.mp4"], [[4.82, 9.54], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5617394/5617394-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"], [[9.54, 14.34], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/857045/857045-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4"], [[14.34, 19.2], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/4625318/4625318-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"], [[19.2, 23.34], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/8957259/8957259-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"], [[23.34, 28.78], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/1375993/1375993-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4"], [[28.78, 29.24], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/7154839/7154839-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"]], "voiceover_duration": 30.336, "video_path": "videos/2025-05-12_21-26-14 - How Love Can Transform Your Life .mp4", "yt_title": "How Love Can Transform Your Life \ud83d\udc96", "yt_description": "Discover the power of love and how it can motivate you to grow and thrive. #Love #Motivation #Transformation"}, "10": {"_id": "4f5d5e0c3be849ada4742e36", "content_type": "general_video", "ready_to_upload": false, "last_completed_step": 8, "language": "English", "auto_music": true, "background_music_name": "Music dj quads", "script": "In the journey of life, the greatest adventures begin with a single step. Every success, no matter how small, is a stepping stone to something bigger. Remember, your potential is limitless, and your dreams are within reach. Keep moving forward, stay inspired, and never lose sight of what you\u2019re capable of.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/4f5d5e0c3be849ada4742e36/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/4f5d5e0c3be849ada4742e36/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.18, 0.62], "In the journey"], [[0.62, 0.8], "of"], [[0.8, 1.36], "life, the"], [[1.36, 1.64], "greatest"], [[1.64, 2.12], "adventures"], [[2.12, 2.88], "begin with a"], [[2.88, 3.12], "single"], [[3.12, 4.72], "step. Every"], [[4.72, 5.58], "success, no"], [[5.58, 6.0], "matter how"], [[6.0, 6.76], "small, is a"], [[6.76, 7.4], "stepping stone"], [[7.4, 7.88], "to something"], [