ount and perform simple math. Dogs truly are amazing!", "format_vertical": false, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/a77a6c3a68674f38bf4050a3/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/a77a6c3a68674f38bf4050a3/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.16, 0.98], "Did you know that dogs"], [[0.98, 1.44], "have three"], [[1.44, 3.24], "eyelids? The third"], [[3.24, 4.52], "one, called the nictitating"], [[4.52, 5.92], "membrane, helps keep their"], [[5.92, 6.56], "eyes moist and"], [[6.56, 8.78], "clean. And here's another fun"], [[8.78, 10.18], "fact, a dog's nose is"], [[10.18, 11.2], "as unique as a human"], [[11.2, 13.46], "fingerprint. No two are the"], [[13.46, 15.72], "same. Dogs can also hear"], [[15.72, 17.12], "frequencies and sounds that"], [[17.12, 17.48], "humans"], [[17.62, 18.76], "can't, which is why they"], [[18.76, 19.34], "can hear dog"], [[19.34, 19.66], "whistles."], [[20.62, 21.8], "Plus, did you know that"], [[21.8, 23.08], "dogs can understand up to"], [[23.08, 24.44], "250 words and"], [[24.44, 26.74], "gestures? That's as many as"], [[26.74, 27.3], "a two-year-old"], [[27.3, 29.34], "child. And if that's not"], [[29.34, 29.72], "impressive"], [[29.76, 31.1], "enough, they can count and"], [[31.1, 31.76], "perform simple"], [[31.42, 34.24], "math. Dogs truly are amazing."]], "timed_video_searches": [[[0.16, 4.52], ["dog face", "puppy eyes", "canine closeup"]], [[4.52, 9.34], ["eye closeup", "blinking eyes", "eye moisture"]], [[9.34, 13.46], ["nose closeup", "dog sniffing", "unique nose"]], [[13.46, 17.62], ["dog ears", "listening dog", "hearing range"]], [[17.62, 21.8], ["human ear", "sound waves", "frequency spectrum"]], [[21.8, 26.74], ["dog training", "obedience class", "command response"]], [[26.74, 31.42], ["child learning", "counting toys", "math blocks"]], [[31.42, 34.24], ["dog puzzle", "smart pet", "canine intelligence"]]], "timed_video_urls": [[[0.16, 4.52], "https://videos.pexe