ve is the greatest motivator"], [[1.6, 1.8], "in"], [[1.8, 3.76], "life. It gives us the"], [[3.76, 5.08], "strength to overcome our fears"], [[5.08, 6.18], "and the courage to face"], [[6.18, 6.4], "our"], [[6.4, 8.24], "challenges. When we"], [[8.24, 9.54], "love, we are inspired to"], [[9.54, 10.44], "be better versions of"], [[10.44, 12.84], "ourselves. Love pushes us to"], [[12.84, 13.34], "grow, to"], [[13.34, 14.56], "learn, and to strive for"], [[14.56, 14.68], "our"], [[14.68, 16.84], "dreams. It connects us to"], [[16.84, 18.0], "others and fills our lives"], [[18.0, 18.82], "with purpose and"], [[18.82, 19.12], "meaning."], [[20.16, 21.3], "So, let love be your"], [[21.3, 23.02], "guide. Embrace"], [[23.02, 23.78], "it, nurture"], [[23.54, 24.68], "it, and let it motivate"], [[24.34, 26.06], "you every step of the way."]], "timed_video_searches": [[[0.0, 4.324], ["hand holding", "heart beating", "cuddling couple"]], [[4.324, 8.648], ["smiling faces", "hugging friends", "group laughter"]], [[8.648, 12.972], ["mountain hike", "ocean waves", "sunset beach"]], [[12.972, 17.296], ["city skyline", "street lights", "night traffic"]], [[17.296, 21.62], ["handshake business", "team meeting", "office work"]], [[21.62, 25.944], ["garden flowers", "child playing", "family picnic"]]], "timed_video_urls": [[[0.0, 4.324], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/4110671/4110671-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"], [[4.324, 8.648], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/6299081/6299081-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"], [[8.648, 12.972], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/857045/857045-hd_1920_1080_30fps.mp4"], [[12.972, 17.296], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/30180831/12941168_1920_1080_60fps.mp4"], [[17.296, 21.62], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/3251737/3251737-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"], [[21.62, 25.944], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/7670542/7670542-hd_1920_1080_25fps.mp4"]], "background_music_url": null, "voiceover_duration": 27.0, "video_path": "videos/2025-05-12_21-46-18 - How Love Can Be Your Greatest Motivator .mp4", "yt_title": "How Love Can Be Your Greatest Motivator \ud83c\udf39", "yt_description": "Discover the power of love to inspire growth and courage. #Motivation #Love"}, "13": {"_id": "609e962926164e5f9ef65e1f", "content_type": "general_video", "ready_to_upload": true, "last_completed_step": 10, "language": "English", "auto_music": true, "background_music_name": "blue yungkai", "script": "Did you know that the journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step? It\u2019s easy to feel overwhelmed by big goals. But breaking them down into small, manageable tasks can make them feel achievable. Every day, set one small goal for yourself. It could be anything from exercising for five minutes to reading a single page of a book. These tiny victories can build up over time, giving you the momentum and confidence to tackle bigger challenges. Remember, success is a journey, not a destination. Each step forward, no matter how small, is a step closer to achieving your dreams.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/609e962926164e5f9ef65e1f/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/609e962926164e5f9ef65e1f/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.18, 0.56], "Did you know"], [[0.56, 0.86], "that the"], [[0.86, 1.32], "journey of a"], [[1.32, 1.86], "thousand miles"], [[1.86, 2.6], "begins with a"], [[2.6, 2.86], "single"], [[2.86, 4.64], "step? It's easy"], [[4.64, 5.06], "to feel"], [[5.06, 5.82], "overwhelmed by"], [[5.82, 6.04], "big"], [[6.04, 7.56], "goals. But"], [[7.56, 8.1], "breaking them"], [[8.1, 8.54], "down into"], [[8.54, 8.86], "small,"], [[9.1, 9.46], "manageable"], [[9.46, 10.36], "tasks can make"], [[10.36, 10.78], "them feel"], [[10.78, 11.26], "achievable."], [[12.34, 12.54], "Every"], [[12.54, 13.42], "day, set one"], [[13.42, 14.14], "small goal for"], [[14.14, 15.68], "yourself. It"], [[15.68, 16.0], "could be"], [[16