, and never give up. Your potential is limitless, and your future is bright. Keep pushing, because the best is yet to come.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/e0c267b885354c46a46509ea/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/e0c267b885354c46a46509ea/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.2, 0.92], "Life is full of"], [[0.92, 1.7], "challenges, but"], [[1.7, 2.18], "it's how we"], [[2.18, 2.76], "face them that"], [[2.76, 3.36], "defines our"], [[3.36, 4.9], "journey. Every"], [[4.9, 5.7], "setback is a"], [[5.7, 6.32], "set-up for a"], [[6.32, 6.6], "comeback."], [[7.64, 8.12], "Believe in"], [[8.12, 8.68], "yourself and"], [[8.68, 8.82], "your"], [[8.82, 10.52], "abilities. Each"], [[10.52, 10.74], "step"], [[10.74, 11.48], "forward, no"], [[11.48, 11.9], "matter how"], [[11.9, 12.7], "small, is a"], [[12.7, 13.22], "step toward"], [[13.22, 13.86], "achieving your"], [[13.86, 15.48], "dreams. Stay"], [[15.48, 16.42], "motivated, stay"], [[16.42, 17.16], "focused and"], [[17.16, 17.58], "never give"], [[17.58, 18.94], "up. Your"], [[18.94, 19.6], "potential is"], [[19.6, 20.3], "limitless and"], [[20.3, 21.04], "your future is"], [[21.04, 22.56], "bright. Keep"], [[22.56, 23.3], "pushing because"], [[23.3, 24.2], "the best is yet"], [[24.0, 24.58], "to come."]], "timed_video_searches": [[[0.0, 4.324], ["morning sunrise", "coffee cup", "book reading"]], [[4.324, 9.56], ["mountain climb", "ocean waves", "forest trail"]], [[9.56, 14.8], ["city skyline", "office work", "gym workout"]], [[14.8, 19.04], ["sunset beach", "star night", "campfire glow"]], [[19.04, 24.58], ["city lights", "night drive", "starry sky"]]], "timed_video_urls": [[[0.0, 4.324], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/6689665/6689665-hd_1080_1920_25fps.mp4"], [[4.324, 9.56], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/31975865/13625267_1080_1920_30fps.mp4"], [[9.56, 14.8], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/5319754/5319754-hd_1080_1920_25fps.mp4"], [[14.8, 19.04], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/31902529/13589187_1080_1920_60fps.mp4"], [[19.04, 24.58], "https://videos.pexels.com/video-files/6924608/6924608-hd_1080_1920_24fps.mp4"]], "background_music_url": "public/blue yungkai.wav", "voiceover_duration": 25.56, "video_path": "videos/2025-05-13_09-14-08 - Every Setback is a Setup for a Comeback .mp4", "yt_title": "Every Setback is a Setup for a Comeback \ud83c\udf1f", "yt_description": "Stay motivated and never give up. Your potential is limitless. #Motivation #Inspiration #StayFocused"}, "17": {"_id": "4fe18743bc574727b100938b", "content_type": "general_video", "ready_to_upload": true, "last_completed_step": 10, "language": "English", "auto_music": false, "background_music_name": "Blue yungkai", "script": "In life, every experience is a lesson, whether it\u2019s a triumph or a setback. Each challenge you face is an opportunity to grow and learn. Even the most difficult moments can lead to the greatest insights. Embrace every experience with an open mind, and let it shape you into a better, more resilient person. The key is to never stop learning and never lose your determination. Stay motivated, because every step forward, no matter how small, brings you closer to your goals. Keep pushing, keep exploring, and keep growing. Your journey is uniquely yours, and every lesson you learn is a valuable part of it.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/4fe18743bc574727b100938b/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/4fe18743bc574727b100938b/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.18, 0.28], "In"], [[0.28, 1.0], "life, every"], [[1.0, 1.88], "experience is a"], [[1.88, 2.56], "lesson, whether"], [[2.56, 3.22], "it's a triumph"], [[3.22, 3.64], "or a"], [[3.64, 5.2], "setback. Each"], [[5.2, 5.7], "challenge you"], [[5.7, 6.34], "face is an"], [[6.34, 7.1], "opportunity to"], [[7.1, 7.52], "grow 