ous creatures continue to surprise us with their unique behaviors and captivating charm.", "format_vertical": true, "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/9eac6cf90c4648639de41df5/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/general_video_assets/9eac6cf90c4648639de41df5/temp_audio_path.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.18, 0.56], "Did you know"], [[0.56, 1.18], "that cats have"], [[1.18, 1.72], "a mysterious"], [[1.72, 2.44], "allele that has"], [[2.44, 2.94], "fascinated"], [[2.94, 3.66], "humans for"], [[3.66, 5.26], "centuries? In"], [[5.26, 5.56], "ancient"], [[5.56, 6.4], "Egypt, cats"], [[6.4, 7.02], "were revered"], [[7.02, 7.38], "and often"], [[7.38, 7.88], "mummified"], [[7.88, 8.28], "alongside"], [[8.28, 10.1], "ferros. They"], [[10.1, 10.72], "have claws that"], [[10.72, 11.1], "retract,"], [[11.38, 11.84], "allowing them"], [[11.84, 12.18], "to move"], [[12.18, 12.86], "silently in"], [[12.86, 13.36], "pounds with"], [[13.36, 15.0], "precision. A"], [[15.0, 15.52], "cat's pairing"], [[15.52, 16.24], "can actually be"], [[16.24, 16.76], "a sign of"], [[16.76, 17.52], "discomfort as"], [[17.52, 17.94], "well as"], [[17.94, 18.46], "contentment."], [[19.46, 19.92], "Interestingly,"], [[20.26, 20.88], "cats don't me"], [[20.88, 21.14], "out to"], [[21.14, 21.54], "communicate"], [[21.54, 22.12], "with each"], [[22.12, 22.88], "other, they use"], [[22.88, 23.32], "this sound"], [[23.32, 24.04], "primarily to"], [[24.04, 24.42], "talk to"], [[24.42, 26.06], "humans. Their"], [[26.06, 26.54], "whiskers are"], [[26.54, 26.8], "highly"], [[26.8, 27.26], "sensitive,"], [[27.56, 28.16], "acting as a"], [[28.16, 28.8], "kind of to help"], [[28.8, 29.36], "them navigate"], [[29.36, 29.74], "in the"], [[29.74, 31.32], "dark. And did"], [[31.32, 31.88], "you know that a"], [[31.88, 32.46], "group of cats"], [[32.46, 33.02], "is called a"], [[33.02, 34.64], "clouder? These"], [[34.64, 34.98], "curious"], [[34.98, 35.4], "creatures"], [[35.4, 36.12