hat\u2019s the most memorable prank you\u2019ve ever pulled or had pulled on you? I was in college, and my roommates and I decided to pull a prank on this guy we all knew, let's call him Mike. We were convinced he had a massive crush on this girl, Sarah. One night, we snuck into his room and filled it with hundreds of red roses and stuffed bears, like a creepy stalker's lair. We even left a love letter on his pillow, signed \"From your secret admirer.\" The next morning, Mike walks in, sees the room, and turns bright red. He frantically starts trashing everything, muttering about how he's not a freak. The real kicker? Turns out, the letter was actually from a girl who had a huge crush on him. Sarah, the girl we thought he liked, bursts in, totally confused. Chaos ensues, and Mike just bolts out of the room. Classic.", "reddit_question": "What\u2019s the most memorable prank you\u2019ve ever pulled or had pulled on you", "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/reddit_shorts_assets/bd4435c44cc741a4ba53af67/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/reddit_shorts_assets/bd4435c44cc741a4ba53af67/audio_voice.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.2, 0.9], "Reddit, what's"], [[0.9, 1.14], "the most"], [[1.14, 1.86], "memorable prank"], [[1.86, 2.32], "you've ever"], [[2.32, 3.2], "pulled or had"], [[2.98, 3.4], "pulled on"], [[3.4, 5.0], "you? I was in"], [[5.0, 5.82], "college, and my"], [[5.82, 6.54], "roommates and I"], [[6.54, 7.36], "decided to pull"], [[7.36, 8.04], "a prank on this"], [[8.04, 8.6], "guy we all"], [[8.6, 9.34], "knew, let's"], [[9.34, 9.68], "call him"], [[9.68, 11.26], "Mike. We were"], [[11.26, 11.84], "convinced he"], [[11.84, 12.32], "had a massive"], [[12.32, 13.04], "crush on this"], [[13.04, 13.3], "girl,"], [[13.52, 15.06], "Sarah. One"], [[15.06, 15.94], "night, we snuck"], [[15.94, 16.56], "into his room"], [[16.56, 17.14], "and filled it"], [[17.14, 17.56], "with hundreds"], [[17.56, 18.3], "of red roses"], [[18.3, 18.82], "and stuffed"], [[1