y gas station and there, on the floor, was a vintage Polaroid camera. Curious, I picked it up and flipped through the pictures. They were all of the same guy, mid-laugh, in different positions, with a weird caption on each one: \"Find the Fake.\" Creeped out, I set it down and rushed out, but not before noticing the guy from the pics standing by the sink, staring at me in the mirror. He just smiled and said, \"Gotcha!\" I bolted out of there faster than you can say \" haunt.\"", "reddit_question": "What\u2019s the weirdest thing you\u2019ve found in a public restroom", "temp_audio_path": ".editing_assets/reddit_shorts_assets/9040644630ba4e67965406ac/temp_audio_path.wav", "audio_path": ".editing_assets/reddit_shorts_assets/9040644630ba4e67965406ac/audio_voice.wav", "timed_captions": [[[0.2, 0.88], "Reddit, what's"], [[0.88, 1.24], "the weirdest"], [[1.24, 1.76], "thing you've"], [[1.76, 2.16], "found in a"], [[2.16, 2.46], "public"], [[2.46, 4.08], "restroom? I"], [[4.08, 4.6], "once walked"], [[4.6, 5.24], "into a public"], [[5.24, 5.86], "restroom at"], [[5.86, 6.4], "this sketchy"], [[6.4, 7.24], "gas station and"], [[7.24, 7.78], "there on the"], [[7.78, 8.52], "floor was a"], [[8.52, 8.74], "vintage"], [[8.74, 9.36], "Polaroid"], [[9.36, 9.68], "camera."], [[10.66, 11.42], "Curious, I"], [[11.42, 11.96], "picked it up"], [[11.96, 12.42], "and flipped"], [[12.42, 12.84], "through the"], [[12.84, 14.46], "pictures. They"], [[14.46, 15.04], "were all of the"], [[15.04, 15.54], "same guy"], [[15.54, 16.4], "mid-luff in"], [[16.4, 16.68], "different"], [[16.68, 17.48], "positions with"], [[17.48, 18.16], "a weird caption"], [[18.16, 18.62], "on each"], [[18.62, 19.5], "one, find the"], [[19.5, 21.12], "fake. Creeped"], [[21.12, 21.88], "out, I said it"], [[21.88, 22.46], "down and rushed"], [[22.46, 23.22], "out, but not"], [[23.22, 23.92], "before noticing"], [[23.92, 24.72], "the guy from"], [[24.58, 24.9], "the pick"], [[24.9, 25.68], "standing by the"], [[25.68, 